Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of floor-wiping is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't put my back into it unless I sing to the beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That is one filthy rag...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, these are your clothes Gama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My food...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What an infuriating brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, you're going to keep working with no food for a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:36.56,Karaoke - 23 the ribbon knight appears 2,,0,0,0,,{\k38}So{\k39}no{\k56}u{\k62}chi{\k90} {\k43}ha{\k33}re{\k64}ma {\k91}mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:36.56,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,One of these days we'll really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Grind fine flour!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So Master Gama can eat top-quality bread baked from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You thieving mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.45,0:12:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, we're ridding this mansion of these filthy mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mice are living creatures, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'll give you my share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because even though things are tough, it's just the two of us, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly... If only your father were here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised not to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need annoying etiquette,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and creepy Duralumin and Nylon aren't here either...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This place...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking at your face gives me courage, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But still... I'm so hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come to thank us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so touched!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought food as a thank-you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, no one is to speak of Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who utters the name... will be whipped over a hundred times
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.21,0:13:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and sent to the quarry as a slave, Lord Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That wretched Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.51,0:13:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're running things terribly, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's not all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because Father and I are gone, they're doing whatever they want!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we could get out of here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of hole is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's deep... It might go all the way down...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, it's very narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can get outside, little mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, there's an exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry and climb up... Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're escaping from this place right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fit through a hole this small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You must escape alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't leave you, Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.17,0:15:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you must escape, even if it's just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And fight the villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you whispering about over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.51,0:15:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Starving... You were probably plotting an escape anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As if you could escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you run, the Queen loses her head in your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,On Lord Duralumin's orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the duty of the Prince of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I'm caught, your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, which is more important?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My life, or the lives of all the poor people suffering at the hands of villains?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, little mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword and clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought them from the Chamber of Patience!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did this man speak Sapphire's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he had the nerve to call King Plastic a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So after a good flogging, we'll send him to the quarry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and work him as a slave until he dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This brat was praising Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, you kept Princess Sapphire alive, but Plastic's gone completely crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You little runt! Whip him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:17:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back just because he's a kid! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just the words of a child. Please forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, or I'll whip both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.63,0:18:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.11,0:18:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight of the Ribbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Suspicious behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a rogue monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your whip tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You dared to challenge\Nme I'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this sword to cut the prisoner's ropes in the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Princess Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, please, at least show us your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even care how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot, Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.71,0:20:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, it's so frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "what"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange fellow suddenly appeared and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,freed all the prisoners bound for the quarry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "strange"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster was a giant, three meters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We almost had him at one point, but... it was that Ribbon kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes, he's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him! Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the "strange" fellow... Guards! Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an intruder at the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack from all sides! Secure the outside of the window, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut off his escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your hands up, or we'll turn you into a honeycomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:20:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's mess him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.72,0:21:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You greedy, cunning Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep harassing the people, the Ribbon Knight won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice sounded an awful lot like Sapphire's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.15,0:21:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,First, split into two groups!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,One group will chase that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The other will go to the Coffin Tower to see if Sapphire is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight is... Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon caught on and is heading to Coffin Tower ahead of us to check!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't hurry back, Mother will be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Gama there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.66,0:22:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.47,0:22:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the tower immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.65,0:23:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your nose is as big as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.39,0:23:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so sure it was Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were any later, it would have been dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.13,0:23:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So much sweat...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So was Sapphire really inside the tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.38,0:23:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck going through all this trouble because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire and the Queen are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.52,0:23:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish them quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.79,0:23:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already made my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.23,0:23:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I hired a hitman who uses three different weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be at the tower by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.29,0:23:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.93,0:23:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How good is this assassin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's never failed before. Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.18,0:24:40.80,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:44.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:44.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
